import lib/std.dl

set base to 1.25 as a 32 bit floating-point number
set exponent to 2.0 as a 32 bit floating-point number
set zero to 0.0 as a 32 bit floating-point number
set square to 4.0 as a 32 bit floating-point number
set negative to (-1.25) as a 32 bit floating-point number
set fractionalup to 1.75 as a 32 bit floating-point number
set fractionaldown to 1.25 as a 32 bit floating-point number

print lines (base raised to the power of exponent), (the sine of zero) and (the cosine of zero)
print lines (the square root of square), (the absolute value of negative) and (the floor of fractionalup)
print line (the ceiling of fractionaldown)
